  "signer": "KATHY HOCHUL",
  "text": " \n                APPROVAL MEMORANDUM - No. 109 Chapter 832\n \n       MEMORANDUM filed with Senate Bill Number 7744-A, entitled:\n \n    \"AN ACT to amend the insurance law, in relation to authorizing divi-\n        dend paying deferred income annuities\"\n \n    APPROVED\n \n  This bill creates a more robust marketplace for deferred income annui-\nties.  Deferred  income  annuities  are good ways for people to save for\nretirement and this  bill  establishes  rate  requirements  that  better\nreflect the structure of deferred annuities that pay dividends. The bill\nalso  requires  certain disclosures related to the non-guaranteed nature\nof those dividends.\n \n  The bill requires a technical change before it can be signed into law.\nA sentence in the section of law that the bill  is  amending  was  erro-\nneously  omitted.  I have reached an agreement with the Legislature that\nwould add the applicable sentence back into law and based on this agree-\nment, I am pleased to sign this bill.\n \n  This bill is approved.                         (signed) KATHY HOCHUL\n \n                                ______\n",
